    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452990/extras/1d7b0985ee93e41128cc514f0afa041d.poster.avif?t=1751988779\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452990/extras/1d7b0985ee93e41128cc514f0afa041d.webm?t=1751988779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452990/extras/1d7b0985ee93e41128cc514f0afa041d.mp4?t=1751988779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What if a classic turn-based strategy became a rogue-lite adventure?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across procedurally generated maps inspired by the landscapes of beloved fantasy worlds. Move between points of interest, conquer foes, recruit a mighty army, and uncover powerful artifacts. Each journey offers new challenges, strategic decisions, and endless replayability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless army composition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans and beasts, demons and undead, dragons and orcs\u2014many creatures await to become part of your army. Each unit has unique passive traits and active abilities. Combine them wisely to create the perfect composition and crush your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452990/extras/Skills.gif?t=1751988779\" width=800 height=408 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Content Through Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete specific conditions to unlock powerful spells, rare artifacts, and diverse heroes for new adventures. Each hero has unique perks and starting forces\u2014find one to lead your army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete Against Other Players' Avatars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter other players' armies on your journey. Defeat them to earn special rewards and glory, and climb the worldwide leaderboard to prove your strategic mastery.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452990/extras/1d7b0985ee93e41128cc514f0afa041d.poster.avif?t=1751988779\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452990/extras/1d7b0985ee93e41128cc514f0afa041d.webm?t=1751988779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452990/extras/1d7b0985ee93e41128cc514f0afa041d.mp4?t=1751988779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What if a classic turn-based strategy became a rogue-lite adventure?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across procedurally generated maps inspired by the landscapes of beloved fantasy worlds. Move between points of interest, conquer foes, recruit a mighty army, and uncover powerful artifacts. Each journey offers new challenges, strategic decisions, and endless replayability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless army composition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans and beasts, demons and undead, dragons and orcs\u2014many creatures await to become part of your army. Each unit has unique passive traits and active abilities. Combine them wisely to create the perfect composition and crush your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452990/extras/Skills.gif?t=1751988779\" width=800 height=408 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Content Through Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete specific conditions to unlock powerful spells, rare artifacts, and diverse heroes for new adventures. Each hero has unique perks and starting forces\u2014find one to lead your army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete Against Other Players' Avatars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter other players' armies on your journey. Defeat them to earn special rewards and glory, and climb the worldwide leaderboard to prove your strategic mastery.</p>",
    "short_description": "A HOMM-like rogue-lite. Gather your army, defeat enemies, and level up your hero. Complete challenges to unlock new content. Experiment with various builds to crush other players' avatars in strategic asynchronous battles.",
